@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Process - configure, select, review and execute
start
:Step 1: choose an enabled profile;
:Step 2: choose edition or configured capture;
:Enter source and destination values;
:Review folder / section matching;
:Prepare all matching operations;
:Step 3: search and review pages of 50 files;
:Include all or save page-specific exclusions;
:Update review digest and log selection;
if (Included blockers or unresolved placement issues?) then (yes)
  :Exclude conflicting files or create a corrected preview;
  stop
else (no)
  :Step 4: confirm the whole included set;
  :Require maintenance and execution permission;
  :Validate digest under the shared plan lock;
  :Queue every included operation;
  :Freeze selection and show progress / cancellation;
  stop
endif
@enduml
